# Example ONLY — the real file is machine-local and gitignored.
#
# Put the real one in the local overlay so it deploys to
# ~/.config/otelbox/edge/endpoint.env, where the wrapper sources it:
#
#   roles/devbox/local/.config/otelbox/edge/endpoint.env
#
# It carries the non-secret remote gateway authority (host:port, no https://
# prefix, TLS assumed). The Bearer ingestion key is NOT here — that lives in the
# login keychain (slot `otelbox-edge-token`), read by the wrapper at start.
#
# The variable name matters: the wrapper and the playbook's preflight both match
# OTELBOX_UPSTREAM_ENDPOINT exactly and refuse to start on anything else. The v1
# collector's OTELBOX_EDGE_ENDPOINT is not accepted.
#
# The optional client certificate is not here either. `make otelbox-edge-config
# ONLY=cert` generates it into the same overlay, one directory down:
#
#   roles/devbox/local/.config/otelbox/edge/client/{client.crt,client.key}
#
# The wrapper exports those paths only when both halves are present.
OTELBOX_UPSTREAM_ENDPOINT=otel.example.com:443
